{
  "id": "vp-failed-break-win-01",
  "title": {
    "en": "Failed Break Above the Value Area",
    "bn": "Value Area-র ওপরে ব্যর্থ break"
  },
  "symbol": "EURUSD",
  "timeframe": "H1",
  "mode": "synthetic",
  "type": "trade-setup",
  "bias": "bearish",
  "outcome": "win",
  "tags": [
    "volume-profile",
    "value-area",
    "poc"
  ],
  "module": "16-advanced",
  "lessonSlugs": [
    "02-volume-profile-market-profile"
  ],
  "caption": {
    "en": "A profile from the first session gives POC 1.093, VAH 1.0945, VAL 1.092. Price pokes above VAH, falls back inside, and the sell at 1.0944 rotates to VAL.",
    "bn": "প্রথম session-এর profile থেকে POC 1.093, VAH 1.0945, VAL 1.092। দাম VAH-এর ওপরে উঠে ভেতরে ফিরে এলে 1.0944-এ sell VAL পর্যন্ত নামে।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "When price fails to hold outside the value area, it often rotates back through it, but that is a tendency, not a rule.",
    "bn": "দাম value area-র বাইরে টিকতে না পারলে প্রায়ই ভেতর দিয়ে ফেরে, কিন্তু এটি প্রবণতা, নিয়ম নয়।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "Trade the return only after price shows it cannot hold outside",
      "bn": "বাইরে টিকতে না পারা দেখে তবেই ফেরার trade নিন"
    }
  ],
